+#   g adv [max]            press a through the current already-shown message (g t shows all of it); stops on new text / yn / menu / battle / lock cleared, and after one press outside a plain message box
 #   g t                    current dialogue text (always prints). Prefix [f]/[b] = live; [f old] = no message on screen (stale buffer);
 #                          [b menu] = battle menu up; " (unchanged Ns)" after 3 s without a change (v2)
